      "hint": "After defeating Morgott, reach the Three Fingers beyond Mohg, the Omen in the Subterranean Shunning-Grounds. Remove your armor to open the final door, inherit the Frenzied Flame, then complete the game. Miquella's Needle can reverse this choice but permanently prevents this ending on that playthrough."
