      "chapter": "Legendary Collectibles",
      "requires": [
        "ACH34",
        "ACH35",
        "ACH36",
        "ACH38"
      ],
      "is_missable": true,
      "hint": "Collect all 9 Legendary Armaments. The key missable is Bolt of Gransax in Leyndell; pick it up before Maliketh changes the capital. Dark Moon Greatsword requires Ranni's questline, while several others are boss rewards."
    },
    {
      "apiname": "ACH15",
      "chapter": "Legendary Collectibles",
      "requires": [],
      "is_missable": false,
      "hint": "Collect all 6 Legendary Spirit Ashes. Black Knife Tiche requires Alecto in the Moonlight Altar, and Cleanrot Knight Finlay is found in Elphael."
    },
    {
