      "chapter": "Legendary Collectibles",
      "requires": [],
      "is_missable": false,
      "hint": "Collect all 7 Legendary Sorceries and Incantations. Ranni's Dark Moon requires completing Ranni's route to the Moonlight Altar, while several others are found in late-game or hidden areas."
    },
    {
